& [UserIntent]
  + continue the Eclipse-to-Cantor integration and custody slice toward a Cantor host that can perform useful auditable work
  + turn the three published supplied-value kernels into one bounded inspection transaction rather than making a caller manually coordinate intermediate receipts
  + preserve the live C checkout and foreign narrative and keep host loading persistence transport model execution update and effects outside this slice

