& [RequiredSurface]
  + introduce one safe-Rust effect-free component with capability kernel.sop.semantic-inspect
  + accept one strict request containing one SuppliedProject one FindRequest one fixed page-hits-with-exact-source projection and one request digest
  + independently assemble the supplied project execute the existing semantic find and recover the exact declared source span for every hit on the returned page
  + return an assembly receipt summary the exact FindResult an ordered one-to-one hit-to-excerpt projection explicit non-authority and one deterministic result digest
  + require each excerpt record identity to equal its corresponding find-hit unit identity and require all generation assembly and query bindings to agree
  + preserve ambiguity pagination and empty-page truth exactly and fail the whole pure computation when any sub-result cannot be replayed
  + bound request query page excerpt count and result size before unbounded work or allocation
  + recognize only kernel.sop.semantic-inspect without admitting a host loader service MCP LSP or the whole cantor_scribe candidate

& [Acceptance]
  + a caller can submit supplied SOP values and one lexical semantic query and receive exact source-bearing hits in one deterministic result
  + exact prefix ambiguity Unicode spans empty results and paginated continuation remain replayable
  + reordered missing duplicated cross-generation or digest-tampered subreceipts refuse
  + malformed oversized unknown-field trailing-value unsupported-projection and over-limit requests refuse
  + focused debug overflow-checked release workspace warnings-denied Clippy format dual-host source and evidence replay pass before publication

& [NonAuthority]
  + composed means a single supplied-value computation and does not mean a resident process transport or host session
  + logical paths remain attribution labels and never authorize filesystem access
  + no filesystem read or write SQLite persistence cache index beyond the existing in-memory scan ranking neighborhood completion evaluation reference graph authoring LSP MCP provider model process installation update remote machine merge publication or external effect
  + no byte from C:\Project\Cantor is modified staged normalized copied back or deleted

& [ProcessingState]
  + preserved_unprocessed_SJS_required
